ambition|orzu-maqsad|Her ambition is to become a doctor.
beg|iltimos qilmoq|I beg you to listen before making a decision.
aisle|qatorlar orasidagi yo‘lak|Please keep your bag out of the aisle.
hunt|ov|The hunt continued until sunset.
stripe|yo‘l-yo‘l chiziq|The shirt has a blue stripe across the front.
former|avvalgi|My former teacher now lives in another city.
